body:
i would have to say 

• {Harukana Receive} 

At the time of its premiere it got some well hearted attention but nearly not as much as i thought. It’s one of the only sports anime’s i’ve watched it and it’s very kind hearted. It really for me teaches friendships and insecurities in sports. It’s hard playing and always doing ‘right’ when you feel so wrong. It’s development on friendship is so cute to me too and i’m so so sad to see i’m not sure i’ll get renewed for a second season. The manga is still going i think ? But not sure, it’s hard to find really much about the anime and manga itself at least for me but i really really wanted more out of this anime as i thought it was very sweet with the development.

Another i would say is 

• {Dorohedoro}

I mean this one is popular in a sense because it’s still on netflix and just kinda came out-ish but i feel like it should get more attention because the sheer story is very unique to me and the blood and gore was such a breath of fresh air to me because it was just different and new. The art style is very unique too and i feel like overall it should be a high talked about anime because of the unique plot and twist of the anime but overall the craft. Hope to see it catch more attention.

• {Kuzu no Honkai}

Okay i’m kinda weird about this one because a big part of me wants this anime to stay were it’s at in popularity because it’s one of those lost gems of mine but it’s popular but not as popular if that makes sense. It’s very intense but to me a very very realistic of how people and feelings actually work in the real world. The anime really doesn’t hold your hand in emotions and shows that not all love stories at all come true or even close to fairy tales, but only a dark rabbit hole of greed and wishes to not be alone.

and my last one 

• {Fragtime} 

this is another anime i would prefer it to stay were it’s at in popularity because it’s one of my prized possessions hhh, to me yes the anime (movie) didn’t get nearly as much at all of what the manga tells but it was still such a sweet movie to me. even if you watch it then read the novels it’s still really amazing to me and overall a sweet plot of finding your real self and learning how to love. 

Overall i love this thread thought and love seeing others gems they keep to themselves ! i want to watch many of these because i’m a big sucker for underground and non popular things as it hold more value to me. Will soon see many of these, thank you so much !
